%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% expect-error: typecheck
% Scenario: interleaved by row, an image 3 rows high and a mask 2 rows
% high are in no integral ratio: typecheck before any data is read.
<< /ImageType 3 /InterleaveType 2
   /DataDict << /ImageType 1 /Width 4 /Height 3 /BitsPerComponent 8
      /ImageMatrix [4 0 0 -3 0 3] /DataSource currentfile >>
   /MaskDict << /ImageType 1 /Width 4 /Height 2 /BitsPerComponent 1
      /ImageMatrix [4 0 0 -2 0 2] >> >> image
showpage
